# Telemetry & Navigation Provider API Keys (All 100% Free / Email Sign-up Only / ZERO Credit Card Required)
# If omitted, Emergency Path Finder automatically uses public zero-key mirrors and offline Delhi-NCR datasets.

# 1. TomTom Traffic Flow API (Real-time probe speed telemetry across Delhi-NCR)
# Sign-up: https://developer.tomtom.com/ (Email sign-up only, No credit card, 2,500 calls/day = ~75,000 calls/month)
VITE_TOMTOM_API_KEY=""

# 2. Stadia Maps / Valhalla API (Ambulance priority routing: ignore_oneways, use_highways)
# Sign-up: https://client.stadiamaps.com/signup/ (Email sign-up only, No credit card, 200,000 credits/month hard stop)
VITE_STADIA_API_KEY=""

# 3. OpenRouteService (ORS) API Key (Avoidance polygons around manual incident blockades)
# Sign-up: https://openrouteservice.org/dev/#/signup (Email sign-up only, No credit card, 2,000 routes/day, 40/min)
VITE_ORS_API_KEY=""

# 4. data.gov.in Open Government Data (OGD) API Key (Official Delhi-NCR Hospital Directory)
# Sign-up: https://data.gov.in/ (Free email registration for Indian developers / open data, No card)
DATA_GOV_IN_API_KEY=""
